# General
HELP.md
.env

# k6 run summaries
k6/results/


# Terraform
# providers downloaded by "terraform init" (big binaries, every machine downloads its own)
**/.terraform/
# state: the memory of Terraform, describes the whole infrastructure. Never in Git
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# saved plans (terraform plan -out=...)
*.tfplan
# personal overrides
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# AWS (terraform/envs/aws)
# inventory written by Terraform: public IPs change every time the servers are re-created
ansible/inventory-aws.ini
# database dumps for the migration: real user data, never in Git
*.sql.gz